  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個由 Serilum 開發的模組。充滿愛意打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>《雙扇門》（Double Doors）是一款極簡風格的模組，讓相同的雙扇門、活板門和柵欄門能夠同時開啟。只需點擊任意一扇（木製）門，或按下單一壓力板／按鈕即可達成。預設情況下，模組也會搜尋其他相連的門類方塊並將其開啟，最遠可達 10 格範圍。此功能可在設定檔中切換。村民也能夠打開雙扇門！ <br><br>蹲下時會停用雙扇門功能，僅開啟／關閉單一方塊。<br><br></span><span><strong>若您希望柵欄門與活板門也能「雙開」，請務必在設定檔中啟用相關選項！</strong><br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG 套件\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可自訂設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>展開詳細內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>enableRecursiveOpening</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>是否啟用遞迴開啟功能。這允許您例如使用活板門建造巨型門，只要相連就能同時開啟。搜尋距離由設定選項 'recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance' 決定。<br><br><span><strong>recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：10，最小值：1，最大值：32<br>當啟用 'enableRecursiveOpening' 時，遞迴函式搜尋的最大方塊距離。<br><br><span><strong>enableDoors</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>啟用後，模組將支援雙扇門功能。<br><br><span><strong>enableFenceGates</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false<br>啟用後，模組將支援雙柵欄門功能。<br><br><span><strong>enableTrapdoors</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false<br>啟用後，模組將支援雙活板門功能。<br><br><span><strong>enableModIncompatibilityCheck</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>檢查是否有載入其他具備雙扇門功能的模組。若發現，會自動修改其設定檔中的對應參數以停用雙扇門功能，藉此修復因程式碼重複執行而導致門無法開啟的問題。<br><br></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示圖\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>適用於所有雙扇門組合，並支援與其他門類方塊的遞迴連鎖開啟！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"332\"><br><br><span><strong>所有相連的門類方塊皆會被遞迴搜尋並開啟：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><br><span><strong>預設情況下遞迴功能會開啟 10 格內的方塊，但可透過 'recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance' 設定進行調整：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong><span><br>點擊兩扇門中的任意一扇，另一扇也會隨之開啟：</span></strong><br></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"848\" height=\"428\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><br><span><strong>使用單一按鈕開啟鐵門，或搭配其他任意組合。</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/e.webp\" alt=\"gif1\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><br><span><strong>適用於上下疊放的活板門與柵欄門，可透過點擊或壓力板／按鈕觸發。</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/f.webp\" alt=\"gif2\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><br><span><strong>村民同樣能夠開啟雙扇門！</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/h.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由將此模組用於任何整合包，只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他需求，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
